/span></div></div><div class="kx-d-sec" data-testid="detail-growth"><h2 class="kx-group"><svg class="kx-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3v18l15-9z"></path></svg>Where the context went since the compaction</h2><div class="kx-d-bars"><span class="kx-d-bar-n" title="output">output</span><span class="kx-d-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--p: 100;"></i></span><span class="kx-d-bar-v">45K</span><span class="kx-d-bar-s">36 %</span><span class="kx-d-bar-n" title="Bash">Bash</span><span class="kx-d-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--p: 76.2;"></i></span><span class="kx-d-bar-v">34K</span><span class="kx-d-bar-s">28 %</span><span class="kx-d-bar-n" title="Read">Read</span><span class="kx-d-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--p: 52.07;"></i></span><span class="kx-d-bar-v">24K</span><span class="kx-d-bar-s">19 %</span><span class="kx-d-bar-n" title="you">you</span><span class="kx-d-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--p: 21.7;"></i></span><span class="kx-d-bar-v">10K</span><span class="kx-d-bar-s">8 %</span><span class="kx-d-bar-n" title="Edit">Edit</span><span class="kx-d-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--p: 18.45;"></i></span><span class="kx-d-bar-v">8K</span><span class="kx-d-bar-s">7 %</span><span class="kx-d-bar-n" title="Grep">Grep</span><span class="kx-d-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--p: 6.58;"></i></span><span class="kx-d-bar-v">3K</span><span class="kx-d-bar-s">2 %</span></div><p class="kx-d-note" title="Estimate: per turn, what the model wrote (output) first, the rest split by length over the tool results (by tool), your messages (you) and attachments and reminders (other); a fall is not counted.">Estimate per turn: output first, the rest split by length.</p></div></div><div class="kx-d-sec kx-d-facts" data-testid="detail-facts"><table><caption>Prompt cache and output</caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Cache TTL</th><td><span><span class="kx-ttl" data-ttl="1h">1h</span> 1-hour</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cache now</th><td>warm · 60 min left (cold at 12:59 PM)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Last turn read from cache</th><td>163K (96 % of the context)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Last turn written to cache</th><td>6K</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Output, whole session</th><td>126K</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Of it thinking</th><td>49K (39 %)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Output, last turn</th><td>864 (347 thinking)</td></tr></tbody></table><table><caption>Session</caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Turns</th><td>140</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A fresh session here typically starts at</th><td>~29K</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Started</th><td>Oct 24 08:50 AM</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Last turn</th><td>Oct 24 11:59 AM (just now)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Model · effort</th><td>Opus 5.5 · xhigh</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Working folder</th><td>/Users/me/Dev/tide-tables</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Process id</th><td><span><code>41000</code><button class="kx-d-copy" type="button" data-testid="copy-pid" data-copy="pid" data-value="41000" aria-label="Copy 41000">copy</button></span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Session id</th><td><span><code>de300000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001</code><button class="kx-d-copy" type="button" data-testid="copy-session" data-copy="session" data-value="de300000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001" aria-label="Copy de300000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001">copy</button></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></article></section>"`;

exports[`panel: the demo sessions > draw the recorded list, all-projects list and detail > header 1`] = `
"<header>
  <h1><span class="kx-n" data-testid="count" aria-live="polite">10</span> live Claude sessions</h1>
  <span class="kx-showing" data-testid="showing" hidden="">showing 10 of 10</span>
  <span class="kx-counter kx-zone-counts" data-testid="zones"><span data-zone="green" style="--kx-zone-fill: var(--kx-green-fill); --kx-zone-text: var(--kx-green);" title="7 of the 10 sessions in all projects are in the green zone"><b data-testid="zone-green">7</b> green</span><span data-zone="orange" style="--kx-zone-fill: var(--kx-orange-fill); --kx-zone-text: var(--kx-orange);" title="1 of the 10 sessions in all projects is in the orange zone"><b data-testid="zone-orange">1</b> orange</span><span data-zone="red" style="--kx-zone-fill: var(--kx-red-fill); --kx-zone-text: var(--kx-red);" title="1 of the 10 sessions in all projects is in the red zone"><b data-testid="zone-red">1</b> red</span></span>
  <span class="kx-counter kx-start-median" data-testid="start-median" title="Start cost: the median first turn of the 8 sessions in all projects that began fresh (not after a compaction). It is the fixed load (CLAUDE.md, memory, skill and tool listings) plus the first message, so a long first prompt raises it"><b>27K</b> start</span>
  <span class="kx-counter kx-abandoned" data-testid="abandoned-count" title="2 of the 10 sessions in all projects had no turn for more than an hour. A closed VS Code chat tab keeps its process running until Developer: Reload Window or VS Code quits, and the panel cannot tell a closed tab from an open one, so some of these are probably closed tabs"><b>2</b> idle over an hour</span>
  <span class="kx-counter kx-cache-counts" data-testid="cache-counts" title="Prompt cache: how many of the 10 sessions in all projects have a warm cache now, and how many went cold"><span><b data-testid="cache-warm">7</b> warm</span><span><b data-testid="cache-cold">2</b> cold</span></span>
  <div class="kx-tools">
    <span class="kx-refreshed" data-testid="refreshed" role="status" hidden=""></span>
    <button type="button" class="kx-toggle" data-testid="compact" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Compact rows" title="Compact rows: title, count and bar only"><svg class="kx-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"></path><path d="M21 9H3"></path><path d="M21 15H3"></path></svg></button>
    <button type="button" class="kx-refresh" data-testid="refresh" aria-label="Refresh" title="Read the registry and every transcript again now"><svg class="kx-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 0 9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0 6.74-2.74L21 16"></path><path d="M16 16h5v5"></path></svg></button>
  </div>
  <div class="kx-zscale" data-testid="zone-scale" role="img" aria-label="Zones on a 0–300K scale: green below 150K, orange 150K–200K and red above 200K"><span class="kx-zband" data-zone="green" style="--kx-zone-fill: var(--kx-green-fill); --kx-zone-text: var(--kx-green); --w: 50;" data-testid="band-green" title="green zone: below 150K" data-fit="long"><span class="kx-zlong">below 150K</span><span class="kx-zshort">&lt;150K</span></span><span class="kx-zband" data-zone="orange" style="--kx-zone-fill: var(--kx-orange-fill); --kx-zone-text: var(--kx-orange); --w: 16.67;" data-testid="band-orange" title="orange zone: 150K–200K · Break at the next phase boundary; continue only if the next phase needs this one verbatim." data-fit="long"><span class="kx-zlong">150K–200K</span><span class="kx-zshort">150K+</span></span><span class="kx-zband" data-zone="red" style="--kx-zone-fill: var(--kx-red-fill); --kx-zone-text: var(--kx-red); --w: 33.33;" data-testid="band-red" title="red zone: above 200K · Do not start a new phase: /clear, /handoff, a subagent, or /compact." data-fit="long"><span class="kx-zlong">above 200K</span><span class="kx-zshort">&gt;200K</span></span></div>
</header>"
`;

